          subject lands. Later, a mining lease deed was executed on 17 th

          September, 2002.
</blockquote>
<blockquote id="blockquote_15">      c. It is profitable to refer to certain clauses of the AUCTION NOTICE and the

          LoA, hereunder.
</blockquote>
<blockquote id="blockquote_16">          AUCTION NOTICE:
</blockquote>
<blockquote id="blockquote_17">          i. Clauses 3 provides that the mining lease shall be for a period of

             seven years from the date of execution/grant of permission for

             mining.
</blockquote>
