</blockquote>
<p data-structure="Section" id="p_22">     iii. Clause 6 provides that “[T]he annual dead rent shall be enhanced by

        50% after the expiry of every three years period of the lease.”

     iv. Clause 13 provides that in addition to the terms and conditions

