f. Aggrieved by the increase in dead rent and royalty, M/s. FGM instituted

     a writ petition10 before the High Court. An application for amendment11

     was filed, which stood allowed vide order dated 12th December, 2007.



<span class="hidden_text" id="span_20">9</span>
   No. S.0.40/C.S. 67/1957/S.<a href="/doc/179857493/" id="a_8">15</a>/2005
<a href="/doc/88742566/" id="a_9"><span class="hidden_text" id="span_21">10</span></a>
