</blockquote>
<blockquote id="blockquote_22">      ii. There was no empirical data or rationale premised on which the

          increase of royalty was sought to be made.
</blockquote>
<blockquote id="blockquote_23">g. It appears that M/s. FGM also filed an application12 seeking permission

      to rely on additional documents received through invocation of the ‘right

